            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the case of a young adult admitted to the Abidjan Heart Institute for coronary angiography to explore unstable angina. Coronary angiography showed multiple aneurysms which suggested sequelae of misdiagnosed Kawasaki disease.</AbstractText>
